From f0f79c44aa85b4262d7f5caba74ef82888dccfd3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ss3ds <ss3ds@localhost>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 14:28:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ss3ds: seed overlays 75 (Wii message), 72 (Nintendo WFC), 73,
 37 and unk_020850F4

Same bug class as 0263: apps reached only through overlay templates stayed [SS-MISSING]. Seed overlay 75 (Continue screen Wii message settings), 72 (Nintendo WFC app), 73 and 37 (launch_application apps) and unk_020850F4, and drop the 68 matching Missing() stubs. Static check: all 580 added functions translate and every new external is a C function in the decomp or the SDK libraries. Not yet compiled or run on device. Left out: overlay 39 (its ov39_0222A1xx helpers have no assembly to translate), 45 and 13 (translator and SOC/WCM gaps), and the Battle Frontier.
---
 .../nitromain-perf/missing.c                  | 68 -------------------
 .../maploader/seed-files.json                 |  7 +-
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 69 deletions(-)

